      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To fetch an API key from a managed secrets store, I will use AWS Secrets Manager as the concrete external provider. I will write a Python script that imports the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with AWS services. The script will use the get_secret_value method to retrieve the API key from the specified secret in AWS Secrets Manager. </thinking>\n",
